flowchart TD
 T[Text question + history] --> J[Next.js route and contextualize]
 I[One inline JPEG or PNG] --> J
 J --> A[POST /api/multimodal/query]
 A --> P[Pillow: validate, orient, resize, strip EXIF]
 P --> V[Voyager Qwen visual observation]
 V --> O[Validated objects / actions / uncertainty]
 O --> Q[Question + unverified retrieval hints]
 Q --> R[MiniLM + lexical catalog / transcript retrieval]
 T --> L[Original question for localization and QA]
 R --> L
 L --> C[CLIP video frames + temporal localization]
 C --> E[Transcript cues + frames + extracted clip]
 E --> B[Backend structured text claims + validation]
 B --> G[Next.js medical-reference generation + verification]
 O -.->|context, not clinical evidence| G
 G --> U[Streamed answer + precise relevant evidence]
